## Design instructions

# Gallos Gold — Premium Betting Aesthetics

## 1. Visual Signature: "The High Roller"
The design language is centered around the concept of an exclusive, high-stakes underground betting club. It uses a **High Contrast** approach where absolute black (#000000) serves as the canvas for rich, textured gold accents. The atmosphere is nocturnal, expensive, and intense.

## 2. Layout & Composition
- **Diagonal Dynamics**: Use the 45-degree angle from the brand image (`shared/login_background.png`) as a recurring motif. This can be seen in background splits, card border-glows, or as decorative "light rays."
- **Focus**: The composition should be strictly centered on mobile to emphasize the "Entry" experience. On larger screens, the login card can be slightly offset or interact with large decorative typography.

## 3. Component Styling
- **Login Card**: A "Floating Monolith" look. High-density glassmorphism (heavy blur, very low opacity black background) with a thin, 1px gold border that has a subtle gradient sweep animation.
- **Inputs**: Dark surfaces with no background by default, only a bottom border that expands or glows in gold (--primary) when focused. Placeholders should be very muted (--text-muted).
- **Buttons**: The primary "Entrar" button must feel substantial. A solid gold gradient (--primary to --secondary) with a "metallic shine" effect passing through periodically.
- **Micro-details**: Use small "embers" or gold dust particles floating in the background to add depth.

## 4. Typography
- **Brand Title**: "Gallo Gold" in high-weight Outfit (#font-h1) with extreme tracking (-0.05em) and a subtle metallic reflection effect.
- **Labels & Copy**: All in Spanish ("Usuario", "Contraseña", "Iniciar Sesión"). Use wide letter spacing for labels to give a luxury fashion vibe.

## 5. Motion & Texture
- **Atmospheric Animation**: Slow, drifting "light leaks" in the background using radial gradients.
- **Interaction**: GSAP-driven staggered entry of the logo, then the card, then the form fields.
- **Grain**: A very subtle noise overlay (2-3% opacity) over the entire black background to avoid flat digital blacks and add a filmic quality.
